\n[Sign up](/signup?ref_cta=Sign+up&ref_loc=header+logged+out&ref_page=%2F%3Cuser-name%3E%2F%3Crepo-name%3E%2Fvoltron%2Fissues_fragments%2Fissue_layout&source=header-repo&source_repo=link-assistant%2Fhive-mind)\n\nAppearance settings\n\nYou signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. Dismiss alert\n\n                               \n\n1.  [link-assistant](/link-assistant)\n2.  [hive-mind](/link-assistant/hive-mind)\n\n## Repository navigation\n\n-   [Code](/link-assistant/hive-mind)\n-   [Issues129 (129)](/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues)\n-   [Pull requests155 (155)](/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls)\n-   [Actions](/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions)\n-   [Projects](/link-assistant/hive-mind/projects)\n-   [Security and quality](/link-assistant/hive-mind/security)\n-   [Insights](/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulse)\n\nMore items\n\n                                                                                                                                                             [](/link-assistant/hive-mind)\n\n# Implement Hello World in Scala #3544\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nOpen\n\nOpen\n\n[Implement Hello World in Scala](/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3544#top)#3544\n\nCopy link\n\nLabels\n\n[e2e-taskIsolated automation fixture](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22e2e-task%22)Isolated automation fixture[no-formal-ai-draftIsolated automation fixture](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22no-formal-ai-draft%22)Isolated automation fixture\n\n## Description\n\n[![@github-actions](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/apps/github-actions)\n\n[github-actions](https://github.com/apps/github-actions)\n\nbot\n\nopened [on Oct 19, 2026](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3544#issue-5923618058)\n\nIssue body actions\n\n## Task\n\nPlease implement a \"Hello World\" program in Scala.\n\n## Requirements\n\n1.  Create a file with the appropriate extension for Scala\n2.  The program should print exactly: `Hello, World!`\n3.  Add clear comments explaining the code\n4.  Ensure the code follows Scala best practices and idioms\n5.  If applicable, include build/run instructions in a comment at the top of the file\n6.  **Create a GitHub Actions workflow that automatically runs and tests the program on every push and pull request**\n\n## Expected Output\n\nWhen the program runs, it should output:\n\n```\nHello, World!\n```\n\n## GitHub Actions Requirements\n\nThe CI/CD workflow should:\n\n-   Trigger on push to main branch and on pull requests\n-   Set up the appropriate Scala runtime/compiler\n-   Run the Hello World program\n-   Verify the output is exactly \"Hello, World!\"\n-   Show a green check mark when tests pass\n\nExample workflow structure:\n\n-   Checkout code\n-   Setup Scala environment\n-   Run the program\n-   Assert output matches expected string\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n-   The implementation should be simple and straightforward\n-   Focus on clarity and correctness\n-   Use the standard library only (no external dependencies unless absolutely necessary for Scala)\n-   The GitHub Actions workflow should be in `ci/` directory\n-   The workflow should have a meaningful name like `test-hello-world.yml`\n-   Save the workflow as `ci/test-hello-world.yml`, not under `.github/workflows/`: this repository's token cannot push workflow files, so the test harness copies it there and runs it\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n-    Program file created with correct extension\n-    Code prints \"Hello, World!\" exactly\n-    Code is properly commented\n-    Code follows Scala conventions\n-    Instructions for running the program are included (if needed)\n-    GitHub Actions workflow created and passing\n-    CI badge showing build status (optional but recommended)\n\nReactions are currently unavailable\n\n## Activity\n\n1.  [![](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?s=64&v=4)github-actions](/apps/github-actions)\n    \n    added\n    \n    [e2e-taskIsolated automation fixture](/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22e2e-task%22)Isolated automation fixture\n    \n    [no-formal-ai-draftIsolated automation fixture](/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22no-formal-ai-draft%22)Isolated automation fixture\n    \n    [on Oct 19, 2026](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3544#event-33641768059)\n    \n\n[Sign up for free](/signup?return_to=https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3544) **to join this conversation on GitHub.** Already have an account? [Sign in to comment](/login?return_to=https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3544)\n\n## Metadata\n\n## Metadata\n\n### Assignees\n\nNo one assigned\n\n### Labels\n\n[e2e-taskIsolated automation fixture](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22e2e-task%22)Isolated automation fixture[no-formal-ai-draftIsolated automation fixture](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22no-formal-ai-draft%22)Isolated automation fixture\n\n### Type\n\nNo type\n\n### Projects\n\nNo projects\n\n### Milestone\n\nNo milestone\n\n### Relationships\n\nNone yet\n\n### Development\n\nNo branches or pull requests\n\n## Issue actions\n\n-   ![](https://github.githubassets.com/assets/github-copilot-app-light-15ad5534265eeacd.svg)Open in GitHub Copilot app\n\n## Footer\n\n[](https://github.com)© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\n\n### Footer navigation\n\n-   [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\n-   [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\n-   [Security](https://github.com/security)\n-   [Status](https://www.g